      "uniswap_v4": {
        "universal_router": "0x8876789976decbfcbbbe364623c63652db8c0904",
        "permit2": "0x000000000022d473030f116ddee9f6b43ac78ba3",
        "quoter": "0x8dc178efb8111bb0973dd9d722ebeff267c98f94",
        "how": "Universal Router execute(commands, inputs, deadline): command 0x10 = V4_SWAP; its input = abi.encode(actions, params) with actions 0x06 SWAP_EXACT_IN_SINGLE, 0x0c SETTLE_ALL, 0x0f TAKE_ALL (TAKE_ALL pays the caller: the vault). Leaves, depth first: 0 command, 1 actions, 2-6 pool key, 7 zeroForOne, 8 amountIn, 9 minimum out, 10 hookData, 11/12 settle currency/max (= 8), 13/14 take currency/min (= 9), 15 deadline, 16 ETH value (= 8, ETH-in swaps only).",
        "pool": "ETHNVDA's own pool: ETH/NVDA, fee 1%, tick spacing 200, no hook (read from the pair token's poolKey() on a fork, 2026-11-06)"
      },
      "basket": "StonkBrokers has no basket or fund contract to deposit into: its 'Investment accounts' (stonkbrokers.io/integration/invest: StonkBroker Accounts NFT 0x0ef148BC47B18E5C93314Da76931860175d4bC2E, open() / openFor(to)) are per-user ERC-6551 wallets, whose trades go through executeCall(to, value, data) with arbitrary calldata (not templatable without letting a caller pick the call). The flows' basket is therefore the ETHNVDA pair token (pairtoken_ethnvda_zap_eth: ETH + NVDA in one Uniswap v4 position) or Smart LP (sdAMZN-FR-USDG, USDG in). Checked 2026-11-06.",
      "ladder_flow": {
        "about": "The take-profit ladder as remote flow nodes (contracts/brain/src/remote.rs), as run in contracts/sandbox/tests/ladder_fork_robinhood.rs: node 0 buys NVDA with ETH and splits it 3,333 bps to each rung; rungs 1-3 sell at NVDA >= $270 / $360 / $540 (1.5x / 2x / 3x of $180, Pyth feed a470c4ac46f44b547b2cba52338f311fb642b79375ce5f0cfd5cb5b99227b852 via oracle_setup name 'nvda'); each sale's ETH goes to node 4, which zaps it into ETHNVDA. Needs approve_nvda_permit2 and permit2_nvda_universal_router once.",
        "nodes": [
          {
