  "about_intents_deposits": "intents_deposits: money INTO the vault's own NEAR Intents account from its EVM address (relay vaults / the brain only). {deposit_address} is the vault's Intents deposit address on that chain, which the OWNER looks up once from the bridge API (POST https://bridge.chaindefuser.com/rpc, method deposit_address, params [{account_id: <vault>, chain: 'eth:8453' or 'eth:4663'}]; the same address on every EVM chain) and pins here: the keeper only fills the amount, capped. A plain transfer has function '' (value only, no calldata). Tested on a Base fork: contracts/sandbox/tests/hop_fork.rs."
